sequenceDiagram
    participant D as AI Director (Module 10)
    participant O as Production Orchestrator
    participant S as Scene Planner
    participant A as Asset Resolver
    participant C as Consistency Manager
    participant R as Render Pipeline
    participant Q as QA
    participant P as Publishing

    D->>O: Start Production
    O->>S: Build Scene Plan
    S->>A: Request Asset Package
    A-->>S: Asset Package Ready
    S->>O: Scene Plan Complete
    O->>C: Validate Consistency
    C-->>O: Validation Passed
    O->>R: Submit Render Job
    R-->>O: Render Complete
    O->>Q: Run Quality Assurance
    Q-->>O: QA Approved
    O->>P: Publish Production
    P-->>D: Production Complete
